================================

A universal interatomic potential for advanced materials modeling

Model authors
-------------

- Arslan Mazitov (arslan.mazitov@epfl.ch)
- Filippo Bigi
- Matthias Kellner
- Paolo Pegolo
- Davide Tisi
- Guillaume Fraux
